        "Id": "684fe18c7179572955a76c9d6b8c981a",
        "Title": "Describe the field",
        "DescriptionText": "The complement of Condition.Equals, and worth preferring over wrapping Equals in Condition.Not: the two read the same to the form and rather differently to whoever opens the graph next.",
